<title>USA: TABLE - Banyan Systems Q2 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Banyan Systems Q2 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended	Six months ended</p>
<p>				   June 30,		   June 30,</p>
<p>			  1997	    1996	1997	  1996</p>
<p>Total revenues    17,073	  30,201    37,104	60,133</p>
<p>Restructuring and</p>
<p>   other charges   9,700	    ---	9,700	   ---</p>
<p>Net (loss)/income</p>
<p>		    ($13,665)	   $186  ($20,057)	 $555</p>
<p>Net (loss)/income</p>
<p> per common share ($0.79)	  $0.01    ($1.16)	$0.03</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of common shares</p>
<p> outstanding	 17,306	  17,262    17,279	17,264</p>
<p>NOTE:  The second quarter of 1997 includes a reduction in inventories of approximately $3 million and restructuring and other charges of $9.7 million, or $0.56 per share, of which approximately $3 million is cash-related, for severance costs associated with a 22 percent reduction in the company's work force, as well as charges related to facility and product line consolidations.</p>
